   - `engine/checks/helpers/repo-context.mjs`'s `buildContext({root, mode, transcriptPath})` and `engine/checks/helpers/work.mjs`'s `runRule(rule, ctx)` — the standard test harness API for exercising a rule module.
   - `engine-tests/helpers.mjs`: `makeRepo({base, changed, uncommitted})`, `cleanup(root)`, `makeTranscript(entries)`, `declaredCheck(dir, id)`.
   - `engine/checks/helpers/session-transcript.mjs`: `classificationLine(text)`, `classesIn(line)` — used by comment-class-menu style checks (now reverted).
   - `engine/checks/helpers/github-workflows.mjs`: `workflowFiles(ctx)`, `WORKFLOW_FILE` regex.
   - `engine-tests/rule-index.test.mjs` + `engine-tests/rule-index.mjs`: verifies every pack README's rule-index table matches RULES.md's bullet order/word-counts, and every discovered check (`worldRules`+`workRules`+`skillChecks`) has a README row with a valid severity/reason from closed vocabularies `SEVERITIES`/`REASONS`.
